## Single-host slave simulation overrides (infinilm-metax-deployment-opt-20260714)
##
## Source from simulate_slave_localhost.sh / validate_slave_localhost.sh, or:
##   set -a && source .env.slave-sim.example && set +a
##
## SLAVE_SIM_IP: first non-loopback address from `hostname -I` when unset.
## SLAVE_ADVERTISE_HOST: set automatically from SLAVE_SIM_IP by simulate_slave_localhost.sh.

# SLAVE_SIM_IP=192.168.163.151
# SLAVE_REGISTRY_URL / SLAVE_ROUTER_URL: omit to auto-use http://<SLAVE_SIM_IP>:<port>
# (127.0.0.1 does not work from inside the slave container.)
# SLAVE_XIYAN_API_PORT=8200       # default; use 8300 only if master Qwen kept on 8200
